{"build":"3f725a0@18/11/2026, 19:55:55","data":{"book":{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194}],"nav":{"199":{"prev":{"path":"/en/maha-bhaya-shiankula-e-bhava-tarangini/","title":"Māyā Duratyayā"},"next":{"path":"/en/matala-hari-jana-kirtana-range/","title":"Honouring Rāga-mārg From Afar"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":199,"author":"Śrīla Rūpa Goswāmī Prabhu","first_line":"tuṇḍe tāṇḍavinī ratiṁ"},"title":["The Nectarean Holy Name"],"verses":[{"text":["tuṇḍe tāṇḍavinī ratiṁ vitanute tuṇḍāvalī-labdhaye","karṇa-kroḍa-kaḍambinī ghaṭayate karṇārbudebhyaḥ spṛhām","cetaḥ-prāṅgaṇa-saṅginī vijayate sarvendriyāṇāṁ kṛtiṁ","no jāne janitā kiyadbhir amṛtaiḥ kṛṣṇeti varṇa-dvayī"],"translation":["*(Śrī Chaitanya-charitāmṛta: Antya-līlā, 1.99)*","“I do not know how much nectar the two syllables ‘Kṛṣ-ṇa’ have produced. When the Holy Name of Kṛṣṇa is chanted, it appears to dance within the mouth. We then desire many, many mouths. When that Name enters the holes of the ears, we desire many millions of ears. And when the Holy Name dances in the courtyard of the heart, it conquers the activities of the mind, and therefore all the senses become inert.”"],"isLong":false}],"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en/tunde-tandavini-ratim/","description":"The Nectarean Holy Name — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Rūpa Goswāmī Prabhu with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"The Nectarean Holy Name | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"tunde-tandavini-ratim"}}